---
// ── Try it ────────────────────────────────────────────
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-title">Try it</div>
  <div class="term">
    <div class="term-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <pre><span class="p">$</span> <span class="c">pichi pull ghcr.io/acme/app:1.0</span>
<span class="o">Fetched app:1.0 (portable machine image)</span>

<span class="p">$</span> <span class="c">pichi run app:1.0</span>
<span class="o">Booting VM… kernel measured, handing off.</span></pre>
  </div>
  <p class="illus">Illustrative — the same pull / run flow you'd use for a container image.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .term {
    background: #0a0d12;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .term-bar {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .term-bar span {
    width: 0.7rem;
    height: 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .term pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .term .p {
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .term .c {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .term .o {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
